---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms — Growtick Academy" description="Growtick Academy terms of service for registrations, batches and certificates.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:44rem;">
      <p class="overline">Terms</p>
      <h1>Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="lead">By registering for a Growtick Academy batch or course you agree to these terms.</p>

      <h2>Registration</h2>
      <p>Offline registration is open to anyone with a name, email and mobile number. Each registration is tied to one batch; your registration code confirms your seat. Seats are limited and confirmed on a first-come basis.</p>

      <h2>Fee</h2>
      <p>The GST batch fee is ₹49, payable on arrival at the venue in cash. Your place is confirmed when you register; payment is collected at check-in.</p>

      <h2>Attendance and certificates</h2>
      <p>Certificates of Appreciation are issued to attendees marked present at the session. Certificates can be verified at academy.growtick.in/verify using the verification code on the certificate. Growtick may revoke a certificate if it was issued in error.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>Dates, venue or fee may change with notice; registered participants are emailed at the address provided.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/919513059059">+91 95130 59059</a> or <a href="https://instagram.com/growtick.in">@growtick.in</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem;">© Growtick. <a href="https://growtick.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">growtick.in</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
